02:59:08','Una vez mas participamos del seminario internacional de KOMEI JUKU que se realizo en Katsuura Japon bajo la Direccion de Sekihicjo Komei Sensei.\r\nLos que partiparon estamos muy felices y hemos confirmado un grupo nutrido de Argentinos.\r\nDario Vega\r\nMitsuko Cesario\r\nJorge Ruiz\r\nAriel Dapice\r\nNicolas Alsinet\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3397\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/001.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3398\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/00.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3399\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/13.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"960\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3400\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/12-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"719\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3401\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/11.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"835\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3402\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"719\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3403\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/09.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"607\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3404\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/08.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"719\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3405\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/07.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"719\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3406\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/06.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"719\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3407\" src=\"http://