lo Edo en Tokio actualmente no posee una torre principal similar a la que tiene el Castillo Himeji. Es un punto de referencia muy usado dentro de la ciudad de Himeji, ya que al estar emplazado el castillo sobre una colina, puede ser vista desde gran parte de la ciudad.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3422\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5905.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3423\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5909.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3425\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5911.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3426\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5912.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3427\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5917.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3428\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5918.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3429\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5921.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3430\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5929.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3431\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5932.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"1200\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3432\" src=\"http://www.komeijuku.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/IMG_5934.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3433\" src=\